# Personal profile overrides — hostnames, machine limits, git identity, repository paths.
# Read in preference to the committed templates one directory up; never committed.
#
# Path-independent on purpose: this rule was pinned to `plugins/project/...` and stopped
# matching the moment the plugin directory was renamed, which briefly put these files into
# a commit. An ignore rule that a rename can silently switch off is not an ignore rule.
**/profile/local/

.DS_Store
